      title: "Jess Kowalczyk",
      content: "Jess Kowalczyk tends bar at the Rusty Anchor five nights a week. Twenty-four, dry-witted and exact with a pour, she lives in 1A with her grandmother and her kid sister Maddie, and spends her days off looking at boats she cannot yet afford.",
