      title: "Maddie Kowalczyk",
      content: "Maddie Kowalczyk is fifteen, Jess's kid sister, and a sophomore at Lakeshore Consolidated. She walks to the bus on school mornings, does her homework at the Bluebird Coffee shop twice a week and spends Friday afternoons on the marina dock, where Dale lets her coil lines in return for a lesson now and then.",
      keys: ["Maddie", "Jess's sister", "the Kowalczyk girl"],
